                              "children": [
                                {
                                  "type": "text",
                                  "id": "Adj7c",
                                  "name": "Missing docs, flaky under load, unresolved security gaps, tech debt that blocks every sprint? We cut through the chaos and rebuild from the core. We bring clarity, discipline, and future-ready architecture to products that can no longer keep up. From in-depth audits to full system reengineering, we restore control — and eliminate the root causes of instability. Every decision we make is designed for the long run. No more patchwork. No more guesswork. No more revisiting the same problems twice.",
                                  "fill": "#232326ff",
                                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                                  "width": "fill_container",
                                  "content": "Missing docs, flaky under load, unresolved security gaps, tech debt that blocks every sprint? We cut through the chaos and rebuild from the core.\nWe bring clarity, discipline, and future-ready architecture to products that can no longer keep up. From in-depth audits to full system reengineering, we restore control — and eliminate the root causes of instability.\nEvery decision we make is designed for the long run. No more patchwork. No more guesswork. No more revisiting the same problems twice.",
